        "content": "What function calculates the latest N-period Exponential Moving Average (EMA) for a time-ordered series of stock closing prices, using the standard smoothing factor \\(2/(N+1)\\), with a specified period such as 10 trading days, and returns the result rounded to two decimal places?",
